{"3867360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hovercrafts x Nihilism", "steam_appid": 3867360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867360/extras/9118aedf5d75d918749417fd2caade21.avif?t=1772852996\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867360/extras_big/9118aedf5d75d918749417fd2caade21.webp?t=1772852996 width=1560 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is dead. No one really knows what happened here, only that time has left it empty. Yet, something dangerous still remains  You are a young revolutionary sent to a distant planet to recover an ancient power while your movement falls apart back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> vast low-poly landscapes in a heavy, yet powerful hovercraft. Movement is fast but deliberate. Master low friction driving through your journey </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867360/extras/5524633d7bfa2a4b68ce23011a209955.poster.avif?t=1772852996\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867360/extras/5524633d7bfa2a4b68ce23011a209955.webm?t=1772852996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867360/extras/5524633d7bfa2a4b68ce23011a209955.mp4?t=1772852996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt</strong> towering entities across open terrain. Boss fights blend precise driving and careful aim. Put your driving skills to the test</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867360/extras/64b49de1f46e086b2fa15895a7761f28.poster.avif?t=1772852996\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867360/extras/64b49de1f46e086b2fa15895a7761f28.webm?t=1772852996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867360/extras/64b49de1f46e086b2fa15895a7761f28.mp4?t=1772852996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A PS2-era inspired world about collapse, belief, and what remains after everything fails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Details:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative Elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-4 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Techno Soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 Bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867360/extras/9118aedf5d75d918749417fd2caade21.avif?t=1772852996\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867360/extras_big/9118aedf5d75d918749417fd2caade21.webp?t=1772852996 width=1560 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is dead. No one really knows what happened here, only that time has left it empty. Yet, something dangerous still remains  You are a young revolutionary sent to a distant planet to recover an ancient power while your movement falls apart back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> vast low-poly 